annon candice for being  so helpful in answering so many of the  technical questions  as related to the vaccine but i want to  stress  to the uh general public that  things are looking a lot better you know  our numbers haven't been great i get  that  everybody understands that but we have  hope now  a vaccine is coming within weeks we will  begin  distributing and giving people needle  sticks  i mean that's a positive thing this has  been done in record time  and it's our hope that we can get as  much of this as we can out in the  general public  we'll build more and more immunity and  we can start to get back to our regular  lives and  it's our hope that all the vans and i  think more nevadans want to get the  vaccine than don't  and we're going to have a shortage on  that side not people not wanting to get  it so  in the meantime we need to continue  doing everything that we were doing  wearing masks practicing the social  distancing  washing your hands avoiding large  gatherings those  things all make a difference that will  help us build the bridge  stronger to get to the other side where  there'll be enough  vaccine available for everybody that  wants it to get it  and hopefully that'll be sooner rather  than later so thank you for joining me  we appreciate it and have a great night  everyone
 

